{
    "article_summary": "This article describes the development of a new catalytic system for the chemoselective photooxidation of sulfides to sulfoxides using Pt(II) coordination complexes as visible light photocatalysts. The method demonstrates a wide substrate scope including aryl, alkyl, and heterocyclic sulfides, and is successfully implemented in both batch and continuous flow processes with high yields and complete chemoselectivity over sulfone formation.",
